41633::$$$message_0318_0000_0000$$$::"Promotional illustration #1. We'll call it promo art, for short."::
41634::$$$message_0318_0001_0000$$$::"It's rare to get a glimpse of Taiga Fujimura's feet."::
41635::$$$message_0318_0002_0000$$$::"Huh? Loafers?[br]I always had the impression she wears slippers everywhere."::
